{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of solutions in positive integers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/3/fe354f8a5221515627afe8ecaf7d34569b5201ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+3y=763$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6b92a36e55aded31339dfb1297d27b1a19659a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 255 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 254\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 128 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 127 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81c2b0503bad322eacd9621096bab6b4f42c137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{763-3y}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"105\" height=\"37\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are both positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eee9f29f9b369858746feeed634593e12a24978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y &lt; 763$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />.  Solving the inequality results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b7574dab53a4d4ce99a6aa0175e6047b069f168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &lt; 254 \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" />.  From the two conditions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can only be an odd number from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/8350ad56249c4928110c3e8b558ca84a2df815af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$253$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5aff9f43a5b6838a7ae07cb73c81ce4ac4304f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> solutions where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is an odd number by contradiction. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is even, then we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/7650378627f9ff965f853568f103dc77975cfd45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is some integer. However, this immediately assumes that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/f/80f83e9d56bfc726cd3ec51231c156394fdbb761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ even } + \\text{ even } = \\text{ odd }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"165\" height=\"13\" /> which is impossible. therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must ben odd. then we can easily prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> .....\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve for first solution by applying extended euclids division algorithm or we can apply hit and trial for the first solution to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c8362488734407d49f674714d31eeddef9fde314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$380$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/721e40b7e0ac4359611aebe48cfb63122a347798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"11\" /> =<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> . then the general solution of the given diophanitine equation will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> +<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae3071ba08f54dbc673f5ef304eec2a96c88657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/721e40b7e0ac4359611aebe48cfb63122a347798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"11\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f65450756c44b33df63c304f031fdfc2751a0d56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />. Since we need only positive integer solutions So we solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c8362488734407d49f674714d31eeddef9fde314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$380$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae3071ba08f54dbc673f5ef304eec2a96c88657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f0cdbd0dbecd281387229d95a014017a0a395a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f65450756c44b33df63c304f031fdfc2751a0d56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f0cdbd0dbecd281387229d95a014017a0a395a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f0cdbd0dbecd281387229d95a014017a0a395a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (applying Greatest integer function) also we can clearly see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/0422656bf6cd17ee1b1946de240745328582bc8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{(min)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"44\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> so,t <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262a080d0d87e973b817945967a512346d8bfc49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934559a7690c08490b9fb854e0435eb6766802e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GIF$\" width=\"37\" height=\"12\" />(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8a51704cc5dbc17abc3c329ec331cc9782f06c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$383$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />/<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />). That implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> ranges from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5aff9f43a5b6838a7ae07cb73c81ce4ac4304f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />. Hence,the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5aff9f43a5b6838a7ae07cb73c81ce4ac4304f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>~Geometry-Wizard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" titl